  "interpretation": [
    "Paper-based CUAD implementation; no matching official GraphPO source was located.",
    "Actor and summarizer Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct; GTE ModernBERT base replaces paper SFR-Embedding-2_R. Extractive selection with at most eight candidates per domain is an explicit representation adaptation.",
    "124 terminal paths were collected over four complete 12-task cycles to exceed the 96-path target. Shared generated edges are trained only once. This is not equal-update or equal-compute comparison against the 96-path methods.",
    "The 16 held-out samples are four questions repeated four times; this pilot does not establish a method ranking.",
    "Legitimate excerpt selection and source validation do not establish semantic sufficiency or state equivalence."
  ]
